<p style="margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text);">We typically recommend PIR for Maidstone retrofit work because the thinner build-up minimises room loss, particularly important in small terraced kitchens and bathrooms.</p>
